    "chunk_text": "Manioc dansal for Vesak\n\nThe annual Vesak dansala organised by the Bloemendhal Police Station was held last night at the station premises. The Officer-in-Charge, Chief Inspector Ajith Peduruarachchi, along with the station staff and local residents, distributed manioc with kochchi sambol to participants. Pix by Kushan Pathiraja"
