    "chunk_size_bytes": 1889,
    "chunk_text": "Pink Eagle consolidates leadership in diversified services and global expansion\n\nPink Eagle Holdings (Pvt) Ltd, a modern investment holding company, has stepped into the spotlight. Established in recent years and rooted in Sri Lankan heritage, the organisation has rapidly grown from a single founding idea and evolved into a diversified ecosystem including tea exports, logistics, warehousing, food production, and hospitality.\n\nPink Eagle Holdings is driven with an ambition to redefine what a Sri Lankan business group can achieve on the world stage,and is growing into a trusted name among international investors and partners, with ventures and collaborations covering Sri Lanka, Dubai, UK, France, Kenya, Ethiopia, China, and Taiwan. The Group continues to expand globally, consolidating leadership in Sri Lanka\u2019s export and service sectors through its subsidiaries Continental Tea (Pvt) Ltd, Abanchy Ceylon (Pvt) Ltd, Continental Freight (Pvt) Ltd, T Co by Adra (Pvt) Ltd, Continental Food Products (Pvt) Ltd, and Pink Panda.\n\nAsitha Silva, Group Chairman and Managing Director, Pink Eagle, emphasized, \u201cPink Eagle\u2019s strength lies in combining Sri Lanka\u2019s traditions with a modern, global mindset. At our core, there is a clear vision to build a resilient and futureready business group that delivers sustainable value, drives innovation, and empowers each subsidiary to achieve exceptional growth and global competitiveness.\u201d\n\n\u201cAt Group level, Pink Eagle\u2019s mission is equally focused on strategically investing in highpotential industries, providing strong leadership and governance, and cultivating a culture of innovation, integrity, and performance. Moreover, the Group is able to unlock synergies among the subsidiaries through collaboration and optimized resources, creating longterm, sustainable value and empowering every business unit to excel,\u201d said Silva."
  },
