    "chunk_text": "The confectionery segment recorded 8.5 percent YoY revenue growth and 8.9 percent YoY volume growth, led by strong performance in Gums and Wafers categories, supported by promotional initiatives and wider channel coverage.\n\nThe Agribusiness sector, represented by Watawala Plantations PLC, recorded 18.9 percent YoY revenue growth in FY26, driven primarily by the strong operational and financial performance of the palm oil business.\n\nPalm oil segment recorded revenue of Rs. 8.4 billion in FY26, a 23.6 percent YoY increase attributable to higher sales volumes and improved selling prices. The palm oil segment recorded PAT of Rs. 2.6 billion, with a margin of 30.8 percent during the year. Revenue from the dairy business declined by 8.2 percent YoY to Rs. 1.1 billion, due to lower milk sales volumes."
