    "md5": "a752930290d625f95dd3b23cc0ef7f60",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1848,
    "chunk_text": "Laugfs leaders recognised at 45 Under 45 CEO Forum Awards\n\nLaugfs Holdings continues to strengthen its reputation as a future-focused and dynamic conglomerate by empowering visionary leadership and nurturing young talent capable of driving transformational growth across industries.\n\nDemonstrating this commitment, Group Executive Vice Chairman of Laugfs Holdings Limited, Mithila Wegapitiya, and Director / Cluster Chief Executive Officer of Laugfs Gas PLC, Niroshan J. Pieries, were recently recognised at the 45 Under 45 Leadership Excellence Platinum Award organised by the Global CEO Forum, in recognition of their outstanding contribution to leadership, innovation, and business excellence.\n\nThe internationally recognised awards programme celebrates exceptional business leaders, entrepreneurs, and corporate professionals under the age of 45 who have demonstrated strategic leadership, industry impact, and the ability to drive organisational growth and transformation.\n\nThe recognition of Wegapitiya and Pieries reflects Laugfs Holdings\u2019 continued commitment to cultivating a strong culture of innovation, leadership excellence, and professional growth. As one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading diversified business conglomerates, Laugfs remains focused on empowering forward-thinking leaders capable of navigating evolving business landscapes while creating long-term value for stakeholders.\n\nA technology entrepreneur and innovation advocate, Wegapitiya has built an international career spanning Management & Finance, Global Marketing, Information Technology, and Digital Transformation. Over the past decade, he has worked with globally renowned organisations including Warner Bros. Interactive Entertainment, Deutsche Bank, Virtusa Corporation, and Ve Interactive, serving markets across Sri Lanka, the Asia-Pacific region, and the Americas."
  },
