    "chunk_size_bytes": 1629,
    "chunk_text": "INFRACON 2026 will bring together industry leaders, policymakers, developers, contractors, engineers, architects, and technology providers, while featuring organisations and suppliers from five major sectors consisting of HVAC-R and Cold Chain, Power and Energy, Green Grid, Safe Water, and Build Materials, which will be showcased within the exhibition as individual concurrent segments, serving as a catalyst for growth and collaboration in Sri Lanka\u2019s rapidly evolving infrastructure landscape, with participation from leading local and international exhibitors, shaping the future of infrastructure development in Sri Lanka and the South Asian region.\n\nINFRACON 2026 is strategically designed as a business-to-business (B2B) driven platform, enabling direct engagement between exhibitors, buyers, investors, and industry stakeholders, where a business focused environment is crucial in facilitating meaningful partnerships, accelerating collaboration and creating new market opportunities within the South Asian region, further reinforcing its core purpose.\n\nA dedicated online platform will be available for both exhibitors and foreign visitors/trade buyers, offering free registration and enabling seamless virtual engagement and collaboration, allowing participants to connect, network, and conduct business from anywhere in the world, and complementing this digital accessibility, the exhibition\u2019s dedicated sector segmentation ensures more focused networking and direct access to targeted buyers, creating stronger and more meaningful business opportunities for exhibitors across both physical and virtual platforms."
