    "chunk_size_bytes": 1059,
    "chunk_text": "Nestled in the heart of Colombo and set to soar 40 levels high, Pentara Residencies \u2013 Thummulla Handiya will effectively redefine the Colombo skyline. Thummulla Handiya is among the most sought-after locations in Colombo, bordering Colombo 3, 4, 5 and the elite Colombo 7. With leading schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and essential services all within easy reach, it offers unmatched convenience.\n\nWith over 80% of units sold since its launch in June 2025, Pentara Residencies reflects the growing demand for luxury living in the heart of Colombo by the most reputed developer renowned for timely delivery of projects upholding the highest quality standards. Home Lands has delivered a staggering 3,750 resort apartments and villas across a portfolio of themed mega residential developments with 500 more units ready for delivery within the next 6 months, while a further 2,200+ units are currently under construction across 8 futuristic mega lifestyle development projects, underscoring the company\u2019s scale, momentum, and continued market leadership."
