    "description": "Palm oil, rubber and coconut: Ending the plantation crop bias",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Palm-oil-rubber-and-coconut-Ending-the-plantation-crop-bias/4-792809",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
