    "chunk_text": "A successful Government cannot afford to treat all taxpayers as a single, uniform crowd. A one-size-fits-all approach results in heavy-handed enforcement that alienates \u201cThe Believers\u201d while failing to educate \u201cThe Strangers.\u201d"
