    "description": "\u2019\u2019I refused to accept privately submitted report on USD 2.5M fraud case\u2019\u2019: Harsha",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/I-refused-to-accept-privately-submitted-report-on-USD-2-5M-fraud-case-Harsha/108-341874",
