    "description": "Dialog Brings Sri Lanka\u2019s Largest Digital Vesak Experience to Matara",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Dialog-Brings-Sri-Lankas-Largest-Digital-Vesak-Experience-to-Matara/273-341915",
