    "md5": "34f9157fb7269f2923696c28b7117dae",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1453,
    "chunk_text": "Three anti-ageing fixes \u2026\n\nAgeing gracefully doesn\u2019t need a 10-step routine. Sometimes the best beauty secrets are already in your pantry.\n\nThese three simple, skin-loving combos hydrate, firm, and brighten mature skin, gently.\n\nNo harsh chemicals, just kitchen wisdom passed down for generations.\n\nYou will need 03 tablespoon of mashed ripe papaya, 01 teaspoon honey, and \u00bd teaspoon olive oil.\n\nMix them together and apply and let it remain for 15 minutes, and then rinse with lukewarm water.\n\nPapaya gently exfoliates, honey locks moisture, and olive oil smooths fine lines.\n\nYou will need \u00bd ripe banana and 02 tablespoons plain yoghurt.\n\nMix and mash well and then apply and let the mixture remain for around 15-20 minutes, and then rinse off.\n\nBanana is plump with potassium, while yoghurt\u2019s lactic acid gives a mild glow.\n\nYou will need \u00bd cup strong green tea and \u00bd cup aloe vera gel.\n\nMix the green tea and aloe vera gel, and freeze the mixture in an ice tray. Glide 01 cube over face in the morning.\n\nCold tightens, while antioxidants from green tea fight free radicals.\n\nBy the way, this is important: Always patch test on your wrist first. Also use fresh ingredients and follow with a good moisturiser, and daily sunscreen, for best results.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
