    "chunk_text": "MBC Networks names Buddhi as CEO\n\nThe Capital Maharaja Group has announced the appointment of Buddhi Wickramanayake as the Chief Executive Officer of MBC Networks Ltd.\n\nHaving been an integral part of the organisation\u2019s media operations over the years, Buddhi brings with him extensive industry experience, strong leadership, and a deep understanding of the evolving media landscape.\n\nMBC Networks includes market giants like Sirasa FM, Shakthi FM, Yes FM, Y FM, and Legends 96.6.\n\nThe newly appointed CEO brings nearly three decades of unbroken, high-performance history within the Capital Maharaja Group, representing a rare blend of deep institutional loyalty and disruptive entrepreneurial drive."
