    "description": "Escaping Sri Lanka\u2019s Roll-Over Debt Trap: Why The MPCC Matters",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/escaping-sri-lankas-roll-over-debt-trap-why-the-mpcc-matters/",
