    "chunk_size_bytes": 631,
    "chunk_text": "Elders\u2019 home fire: Director arrested\n\nColombo, June 4 (Daily Mirror) - The Director of the elders\u2019 home in Batagoda, Anguruwatota, where a fire broke out on Tuesday evening, has been arrested, Police said.\n\nAccording to Police, the suspect is scheduled to be produced before the Horana Magistrate\u2019s Court today.\n\nMeanwhile, the death toll from the blaze at the facility has risen to 12.\n\nAuthorities said three residents remain unaccounted for, while seven injured individuals are receiving treatment at the Horana District Hospital.\n\nOfficials further stated that 72 residents were inside the premises when the fire erupted."
  },
