    "description": "\u2018Suicide risk\u2019 vs \u2018Oscar-worthy act\u2019: Court hears contrasting claims on Sallay",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Suicide-risk-vs-Oscar-worthy-act-Court-hears-contrasting-claims-on-Sallay/108-341991",
    "lang": "en",
