    "md5": "3338bea4c76bce0e691d7551ae94b047",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1413,
    "chunk_text": "Prime Melwa: With rise of Asia\u2019s most distinct marina-front land plot\n\nIn global real estate, truly irreplaceable assets are rarely created twice. Their value is shaped by a rare combination of location, scarcity, architecture and long-term relevance. Prime Melwa have secured one of those rare opportunities through a marina-front land plot that stands apart from anything else currently available within Colombo\u2019s evolving waterfront landscape.\n\nThe historical project in Sri Lankan real estate and infrastructure brings together two of Sri Lanka\u2019s industrial giants and most established corporate forces, Prime Group and Melwa, uniting large-scale real estate expertise with the country\u2019s most diversified conglomerate.\n\nPrime Melwa occupies a most exclusive waterfront land plot overlooking both the marina and Indian Ocean horizon. While many developments may offer views of water, very few are built upon a land plot that enjoys direct marina frontage while maintaining uninterrupted ocean exposure. What gives the project deeper significance, however, is not only its scale. It is the precision behind its positioning. Not all waterfront land plots carry the same value. The difference is determined by frontage, orientation, visibility and proximity to the water. Prime Melwa benefits from all four. This distinction creates something far more valuable than a premium address. It creates scarcity."
  },
