    "chunk_size_bytes": 1187,
    "chunk_text": "DFCC Bank appoints Shamindra Marcelline as Executive Director\n\nDFCC Bank PLC has announced the appointment of Shamindra Marcelline as an Executive Director of the Bank with effect from 15 June 2026, following approval by the Board of Directors and the Central Bank of Sri Lanka.\n\nShamindra currently serves as Deputy Chief Executive Officer of DFCC Bank, where he provides leadership across several key functions, including customer excellence, sustainability, information security risk, logistics & real estate. He also serves as Alternate Chair of the Credit Committee, contributing to Board-level governance and risk oversight.\n\nA banking professional with more than 27 years of experience, Shamindra has built extensive expertise across corporate, investment, retail, and international banking. Throughout his career, he has led business transformation initiatives, driven growth, and strengthened organisational capabilities across diverse markets.\n\nShamindra holds a Bachelor of Science (Honours) degree in Economics and Accountancy from City University, London, and a Financial Advisors\u2019 International Qualification (FAIQ) from the Chartered Insurance Institute, United Kingdom."
