    "date_str": "2026-06-05",
    "description": "Beyond debt restructuring: Sri Lanka\u2019s narrow window to execute a real economic reset",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Beyond-debt-restructuring-Sri-Lanka-s-narrow-window-to-execute-a-real-economic-reset/4-792910",
