    "chunk_text": "Capital Trust Properties Chairperson, CEO and Founder Minoli Wickramasinghe said: \u201cOur partnership with John Keells Properties reflects the standards we have consistently upheld as a company, built on credibility, professionalism, transparency and ethical business conduct. We do not view real estate purely as a transaction. Our role is to guide clients with the right information, support developers with structured advisory solutions, and help create long-term value for all stakeholders. Renewing this partnership is an important step in continuing that commitment with one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most respected developers.\u201d\n\nOver the years, CTP has supported developers and property owners with solutions that extend beyond sales, helping to enhance the value, maintenance, furnishing, rental potential and long-term appeal of residential developments. This integrated approach has enabled the company to serve both developers and buyers with a strong focus on trust, clarity and informed decision-making.\n\nThe company has also continued to advocate for a more sustainable and transparent real estate industry in Sri Lanka. The company has engaged with regulators and relevant authorities on matters affecting the property sector, including the need for stronger regulation of property broking and a more competitive tax environment for condominium developments."
