    "chunk_size_bytes": 1614,
    "chunk_text": "Pink Eagle Holdings consolidates leadership in diversified services and global expansion\n\nPink Eagle Holdings celebrate their trailblazing consolidation into a resilient and future-ready business group\n\nWith bold vision and global outlook, one of Sri Lanka\u2019s trailblazing conglomerates, Pink Eagle Holdings Ltd., a modern investment holding company, steps into the spotlight. Established in recent years and rooted in Sri Lankan heritage, the organisation has rapidly grown from a single founding idea and evolved into a diversified ecosystem including tea exports, logistics, warehousing, food production, and hospitality.\n\nPink Eagle Holdings is driven with an ambition to redefine what a Sri Lankan business group can achieve on the world stage, and is growing into a trusted name among international investors and partners, with ventures and collaborations covering Sri Lanka, Dubai, UK, France, Kenya, Ethiopia, China, and Taiwan. The Group continues to expand globally, consolidating leadership in Sri Lanka\u2019s export and service sectors through its subsidiaries Continental Tea Ltd., Abanchy Ceylon Ltd., Continental Freight Ltd., T Co by Adra Ltd., Continental Food Products Ltd., and Pink Panda.\n\nPink Eagle Group Chairman and Managing Director Asitha Silva emphasised, \u201cPink Eagle\u2019s strength lies in combining Sri Lanka\u2019s traditions with a modern, global mindset. At our core, there is a clear vision to build a resilient and future-ready business group that delivers sustainable value, drives innovation, and empowers each subsidiary to achieve exceptional growth and global competitiveness.\u201d"
  },
