    "chunk_text": "Death toll rises to 13 in Anguruwatota elders\u2019 home fire\n\nColombo, June 5 (Daily Mirror) - The death toll from the fire at the \u2018Senehase Kedella\u2019 elders' home in Batagoda, Anguruwatota has risen to 13, after another victim succumbed to severe burn injuries while receiving treatment in hospital.\n\nThe tragic incident occurred on June 3, when a fire broke out at the facility, trapping residents inside the building.\n\nHospital sources said five more individuals are under treatment for critical injuries sustained in the blaze."
