    "chunk_text": "Monthly figures show that Customs collected Rs. 91 billion from vehicle imports in January out of a total revenue of Rs. 235 billion. In February, Rs. 75 billion was collected from vehicle imports out of Rs. 215 billion. March recorded Rs. 77 billion, April Rs. 84 billion, and by 28 May, Rs. 76 billion had already been collected from the sector.\n\nThe figures have raised questions over whether the surcharge has effectively curbed import demand or whether the impact is being offset by currency depreciation, resulting in higher rupee values rather than a real reduction in import activity."
