    "md5": "f0bef3f1f2c8a032e04ad35a1d27039f",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1755,
    "chunk_text": "Creative Information Technologies opens new premium showroom at Unity Plaza\n\nLahiru Amarakoon (National Sales Manager), S. Suresh (Chairman), Ranjan Ramanayake (Actor), Surendra Ranawaka (General Manager - Sales & Marketing), Suranjith Swaris (Consultant/ Director of Business Development & Sales Operations)\n\nActor Ranjan Ramanayake cutting the ribbon to open the new showroom\n\nCreative Information Technologies (Pvt) Ltd announced the opening of its newest showroom at Unity Plaza on 25 May, further strengthening its customer presence within Sri Lanka\u2019s premier ICT and technology marketplace.\n\nThe new showroom marks another significant milestone in the company\u2019s continuous journey of delivering innovative and world-class technology solutions to customers across the country. Recognized as a trusted name in Sri Lanka\u2019s ICT sector since 2008, Creative Information Technologies has built a strong reputation through its commitment to quality, customer satisfaction, and technology-driven solutions.\n\nCreative Information Technologies is the authorized distributor and agent for internationally recognized brands including Amida, HAVIT, and PNY, while also offering HP, Dell, Asus, MSI, and other leading global technology brands through its expanding retail and distribution network. The company provides a comprehensive range of ICT products and services including laptops, desktops, printer consumables, gaming accessories, CCTV solutions, networking systems, storage devices, and mobile accessories.\n\nSpeaking on the expansion, Subramanium Suresh, Chairman of Creative Information Technologies said the new showroom reflects the company\u2019s long-term vision of becoming the preferred and trusted partner in connecting people with technology."
