    "md5": "0f8904ffe4f314bf3a80894517e9c4b7",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1363,
    "chunk_text": "Seylan Bank opens 291st \u2018Pahasara\u2019 Library\n\nSeylan Bank PLC opened its 291st \u2018Pahasara\u2019 Library at A/Buddhangala Central College, Padavi-Parakramapur recently.\n\nThe ceremony was held on 27 March, under the patronage of Ruwan Maithripala, Zonal Director of Education (Kebithigollewa), T.P. Jayasinghe, Divisional Director of Education (Padaviya), Kapila S. Kumara, Principal, A/Buddhangala Central College, Padaviyaand Jananda Rathnayake, Regional Manager, North Central Province, Seylan Bank and Neel Nishantha,\u00a0 Branch Manager, Padaviya Branch, Seylan Bank.\n\nThe newly refurbished library was officially handed over following the completion of \u2018Pahasara Week\u2019, a series of student-focused engagement activities conducted jointly by Seylan Bank and the school. As part of the initiative, the bank donated books along with a laptop and smart board to support learning and digital access.\n\nSpeaking on the occasion, Asiri Abhayaratne, AGM Marketing and Sales, Seylan Bank said, \u201cSeylan Bank remains committed to funding library refurbishments and providing essential educational resources to cultivate students\u2019 knowledge and skills.\u201d\n\nEducation officials, teachers, parents, and students extended their full cooperation to ensure the success of the programme, with strong student participation recorded throughout \u2018Pahasara Week\u2019 activities."
