    "description": "The Gods have not been kind to our rulers",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/The-Gods-have-not-been-kind-to-our-rulers/172-342138",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
