    "description": "What is more reprehensible; drug abuse or sexual abuse?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/What-is-more-reprehensible-drug-abuse-or-sexual-abuse/172-342140",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
