    "description": "Right of reply Response from the Hajj Committee regarding Mina arrangements",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Right-of-reply-Response-from-the-Hajj-Committee-regarding-Mina-arrangements/172-342142",
