    "chunk_size_bytes": 517,
    "chunk_text": "Strong wind advisory issued for several areas\n\nColombo, June 6 (Daily Mirror) - The Meteorology Department has warned of strong winds over the Central, Sabaragamuwa, Northern and North-Central Provinces and in the Trincomalee and Hambantota districts due to the active South-West monsoonal condition.\n\nThe Department said in an advisory that strong winds of about 40-50 kmph could be expected at times in these areas.\n\nIt said fairly strong winds of about 30-40 kmph can be expected at times\u00a0elsewhere in the island."
  },
