    "description": "Forty Years After the Kantale Tank Disaster, Sri Lanka Still Awaits a Dam Safety Regulator",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/forty-years-after-the-kantale-tank-disaster-sri-lanka-still-awaits-a-dam-safety-regulator/",
    "lang": "en",
