    "chunk_text": "\u201cMiss Polski\u201d beauty pageant arrive\n\nA delegation of 45 members, including 24 finalists of the Miss Polski national beauty pageant, arrived at Katunayake Airport early morning aboard Turkish Airlines flight TK-1130 via Istanbul.\n\nThe group will take part in a special international promotional stage of the competition being hosted in Sri Lanka for the first time.\n\nThe Sri Lankan stage of the competition will run for 10 days in Sigiriya, with additional promotional shoots and cultural experiences planned across some of the country\u2019s most scenic locations such as Sigiriya, Pasikuda, Knuckles / Neela Valley, Minneriya National Park, Dambulla and Colombo.\n\nEach location will showcase Sri Lanka\u2019s cultural heritage, natural beauty, and wildlife diversity to an international audience. Pix by T.K.G Kapila"
