    "chunk_text": "Reshan Liyanage wins Global CEO \u201845 Under 45\u2019 Platinum Award for hospitality leadership\n\nReshan Liyanage, Executive Director and CEO of Regal R\u00e9seau Hotel & Spa under Regal Holdings, has received the Global CEO \u201c45 Under 45 \u2013 Leadership Excellence Platinum Award 2026.\u201d The award, presented at a ceremony in Colombo, recognizes his leadership, entrepreneurial vision, and contributions to advancing Sri Lanka\u2019s hospitality industry.\n\nUnder Liyanage\u2019s leadership, the Negombo-based property has gained recognition for luxury accommodations, personalized service, and innovative concepts such as The Sky Track Lounge & Bar. The hotel recently earned the Agoda Golden Circle Award 2025 for guest satisfaction and service quality. Regal Holdings has also expanded its hospitality portfolio with the launch of Regal Rivera Villa, a luxury boutique villa targeting exclusive traveler segments.\n\nLiyanage attributed the achievement to his team\u2019s dedication and reaffirmed Regal Holdings\u2019 commitment to innovation, service excellence, and promoting Sri Lankan hospitality globally. Beyond hospitality, Regal Holdings operates Sri Lanka\u2019s first and only ISO 9001:2015 certified filling station, highlighting the group\u2019s broader focus on operational excellence and customer satisfaction across sectors.\n\nSri Lankan conglomerates leading the charge in Port City\u2019s economic surge\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
