    "description": "Sri Lanka failing to utilise returns  on women\u2019s education boom: ADB study",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Sri-Lanka-failing-to-utilise-returns-on-women-s-education-boom-ADB-study/14-793000",
