    "description": "Sri Lanka participates in THAIFEX \u2013 Anuga Asia 2026 and Technical Exposure Program in Thailand",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Sri-Lanka-participates-in-THAIFEX-Anuga-Asia-2026-and-Technical-Exposure-Program-in-Thailand/34-793024",
    "lang": "en",
