    "chunk_size_bytes": 331,
    "chunk_text": "Against Sallay\u2019s detention...\n\nA satyagraha organised by several opposition political parties was launched near the Fort Railway Station in Colombo this morning, condemning what participants described as the inhumane and unjust treatment of former State Intelligence Service (SIS) Director, Major General (Retired) Suresh Sallay."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
