    "chunk_text": "'Stories of the Sea'...\n\nArtistes from India and Sri Lanka, together with youth from the Mannar community, presented the drama \u201cStories of the Sea\u201d, highlighting the deep connection between coastal communities and the ocean while depicting the challenges they face amid changing environmental conditions. The performance was staged at the Kamatha Theatre at the Bandaranaike Memorial International Conference Hall (BMICH). Pix by Kithsiri De Mel."
