    "chunk_text": "Trump calls on Iran and Israel to stop \u2018shooting immediately\u2019\n\nAl Jazeera - US President Donald Trump has called on both Israel and Iran to stop attacking each other.\n\n\u201cIsrael and Iran must immediately stop \u2018shooting\u2019,\u201d he said in a brief post on his Truth Social platform."
