    "chunk_text": "A/L exam to begin on August 10; Grade 5 scholarship exam on August 9\n\nColombo, June 8 (Daily Mirror) - The Examinations Department has announced the dates for the 2026 General Certificate of Education (Advanced Level) Examination and the Grade 5 Scholarship Examination.\n\nAccording to a statement issued by the Department, the G.C.E. Advanced Level Examination 2026 will be held from August 10 to September 5, 2026.\n\nMeanwhile, the Grade 5 Scholarship Examination, conducted to select students for schools and award scholarships, will be held on August 9, 2026.\n\nThe Department has also released the examination timetables for both examinations.\n\nCandidates seeking further information may contact the Department through the 1911 hotline or via telephone numbers 011 2785922, 011 2784537, 011 2786616, and 011 2784208.\n\nInquiries can also be sent by fax to 011 2784422 or by email to [email\u00a0protected]."
