    "chunk_text": "Sureshni \u2026 going solo\n\nSinger Sureshni Wanigasuriya continues to be seen and heard but is now pursuing a fresh chapter in her music journey.\n\nKnown for her soft, expressive voice, she\u2019s now performing as a solo artiste.\n\nShe also mentioned that if the requirement is for a duo or trio, then they perform under her previous name of \u2018Europa.\u2019\n\nSureshni is seen in action quite frequently, these days, but she has no contract at the moment that would see her doing her thing, on a regular basis, as a solo artiste, duo or trio.\n\nSureshni\u2019s repertoire include English, Sinhala, and Hindi songs, and Gospel songs, as well, and she has performed with many leading local bands, including Aquarius and Sohan & The X-Periments.\n\nYes, her voice has touched many hearts, and there\u2019s more music ahead.\n\nT20 World Cup: Heavyweights, hopefuls and a debutant headline Group 1\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
