    "description": "CICT handles 2,241-tonne battery storage shipment for SL\u2019s largest energy storage programme",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/CICT-handles-2-241-tonne-battery-storage-shipment-for-SLs-largest-energy-storage-programme/273-342324",
