    "description": "\u2018Climate-Proofing Business Sri Lanka\u2019 Executive Leadership Dialogue to be held tomorrow",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Climate-Proofing-Business-Sri-Lanka-Executive-Leadership-Dialogue-to-be-held-tomorrow/273-342330",
    "lang": "en",
