    "chunk_text": "The move to Orion City reflects the company\u2019s continued growth, expansion of its consulting team and the increasing demand for value-added services across the region. In addition to its established sustainability and certification offerings, Peterson Solutions has further expanded its capabilities in areas such as crop consultancy, sustainable agriculture, digital solutions, data-driven sustainability management and professional training and capacity development.\n\nSpeaking at the event, company representatives noted that the new office represents more than a change of location. It reflects the organization\u2019s broader vision of supporting businesses as they respond to evolving market expectations, sustainability requirements, regulatory obligations and technological transformation.\n\nAs organizations across the region increasingly focus on responsible growth, supply chain resilience, ESG performance, traceability and digital innovation, Peterson Solutions remains committed to serving as a trusted partner that helps organizations move from compliance to competitiveness and from strategy to measurable impact.\n\nThe opening of the new corporate office at Orion City marked the beginning of the next phase of Peterson Solutions\u2019 journey in Sri Lanka; one built on collaboration, innovation, and a continued commitment to delivering practical, value-driven solutions for businesses across Sri Lanka and beyond."
