    "description": "Saliya Pieris calls for safeguards against  long-standing abuses under PTA, ICCPR Act",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Saliya-Pieris-calls-for-safeguards-against-long-standing-abuses-under-PTA-ICCPR-Act/56-793082",
    "lang": "en",
