    "chunk_text": "Two killed in train-three-wheeler collision near Kadana\n\nColombo, June 9 (Daily Mirror) - Two people were killed when a three-wheeler collided with the Muthukumari Express train near the Kadana railway station this morning.\n\nAccording to railway officials, the Muthukumari Express, which was travelling from Chilaw to Panadura, struck the three-wheeler at a railway crossing near Kadana at around 7.10 a.m.\n\nThe two occupants of the three-wheeler died in the collision, officials said."
