    "chunk_text": "Iconic actress Iranganie Serasinghe celebrates 99th birthday\n\nColombo, June 9 (Daily Mirror) - Beloved and iconic artiste Iranganie Serasinghe will celebrate her 99th birthday today. She was born in 1927. She has been a pioneering figure in Sri Lankan cinema. She has earned widespread admiration for her remarkable contribution to the country's arts and cultural landscape."
