    "chunk_text": "Extension of emergency approved by Parliament\n\nColombo, June 9 (Daily Mirror) - The extension of the state of emergency for another month was approved by a majority of 128 votes.\n\nSome 135 members of Parliament voted in favour while seven voted against. Eighty two MPs were absent during the time of voting."
