    "description": "QR payments in Sri Lanka: How to break the \u2018chicken and egg\u2019 situation?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/QR-payments-in-Sri-Lanka-How-to-break-the-chicken-and-egg-situation/14-793094",
