    "chunk_text": "Speaker threatens to remove MP Sujeewa Senasinghe from chambers\n\nColombo, June 10 (Daily Mirror) - In the midst of a heated argument over Standing Orders pertaining to raising questions, Speaker Jagath Wickramaratne today threatened to have MP Sujeewa Senasinghe removed from the chambers.\n\n\"I will have to teach MP Senasinghe the Standing Orders,\" the Speaker said."
