    "chunk_size_bytes": 1503,
    "chunk_text": "First Capital named SL\u2019s Leading Investment Banking Firm by World Economic Magazine Awards 2026\n\nFirst Capital Holdings PLC has been recognised as the Leading Investment Banking Firm in Sri Lanka \u2013 2026 at the World Economic Magazine Awards.\n\nPresented by the World Economic Magazine, the award honours organisations that demonstrate outstanding strategic impact while contributing meaningfully to economic progress and industry advancement. The awards programme recognises distinguished institutions across sectors including banking, financial services, investment, fintech, governance and sustainability.\n\nRecipients are selected through an independent evaluation conducted by the magazine\u2019s research and editorial team, based on key criteria such as company performance and growth indicators, market presence and industry impact, as well as leadership, innovation and strategic initiatives. This rigorous assessment ensures that recognised organisations exemplify excellence, sustainable growth and industry leadership.\n\nThis latest international accolade reflects First Capital\u2019s continued leadership in Sri Lanka\u2019s capital markets and its commitment to delivering innovative financial solutions, trusted advisory services and exceptional value to clients. The recognition further reinforces the company\u2019s position as one of the most decorated investment firms in the country, with a proven track record of excellence, transparency and performance across its diverse business operations."
