    "description": "Suresh Sallay\u2019s circumstances; \u2018Sajith\u2019s body, Ranil\u2019s head\u2019 absurdity damages SJB-UNP",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Suresh-Sallay-s-circumstances-Sajith-s-body-Ranil-s-head-absurdity-damages-SJB-UNP/4-793154",
    "lang": "en",
