    "description": "Canada proposes teen social media ban - with workaround for tech firms",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Canada-proposes-teen-social-media-ban-with-workaround-for-tech-firms/108-342573",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
