    "description": "Central Bank urged to probe into overseas transfers linked to Rs. 13bn NDB fraud",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Central-Bank-urged-to-probe-into-overseas-transfers-linked-to-Rs-13bn-NDB-fraud/108-342598",
    "lang": "en",
