    "chunk_text": "Kuwait reopens airspace, airport returns to normal operations after Iran attacks\n\nDUBAI, United Arab Emirates \u2014 Kuwait resumes air traffic and Kuwait International Airport returned to normal operations after a temporary suspension prompted by Iranian attacks, the civil aviation authority says.\n\nKuwait had closed its airspace and suspended air traffic earlier today as a precautionary measure following Iranian attacks, diverting flights to alternative airports."
