    "chunk_text": "The EOI process is open to both domestic and international entities. Investors are required to demonstrate their qualifications and relevant experience in carrying out the proposed investments. Shortlisted proponents will be invited to participate in the next stage of the selection process.\n\nAirport & Aviation Services (Sri Lanka) also organized a pre-proposal briefing and site visit at MRIA to familiarize prospective investors with local conditions and airport operations.\n\nThe EOI documents are available free of charge and can be obtained from AASL or downloaded through its official website. Interested investors are encouraged to submit their EOIs before the revised deadline and become part of shaping the future development of MRIA as a regional aviation and investment gateway."
