    "chunk_text": "Division 1A Season Kicks Off This Weekend\n\nJune.11 (Mirror Sports) - The 2026 Dialog Schools Under-19 Rugby League Tournament gets underway this weekend with an exciting slate of Division 1A fixtures across the country.\n\nSeveral traditional rivals and school rugby powerhouses will be in action as teams look to make a strong start to their campaigns. Key opening-week clashes include St. Joseph\u2019s College vs St. Anthony\u2019s College, Royal College vs Trinity College, and Isipathana College vs St. Peter\u2019s College, setting the stage for another thrilling season of schools rugby."
