    "chunk_size_bytes": 1910,
    "chunk_text": "LAUGFS Supermarkets partners with Bing Chun to introduce a new lifestyle experience at Pepiliyana outlet\n\nLAUGFS Supermarkets has further enhanced its customer offering through a strategic franchise partnership with Bing Chun, one of Sri Lanka\u2019s rapidly expanding beverage and dessert brands. The opening of Bing Chun\u2019s No.79 outlet at LAUGFS Supermarket, Pepiliyana marks a significant milestone, becoming the first collaboration between Bing Chun and a supermarket chain in Sri Lanka and bringing a new lifestyle experience to supermarket shoppers.\n\nBing Chun, a Chinese franchise brand, has swiftly risen to prominence in Sri Lanka\u2019s beverage and dessert scene. Loved for its trendy, refreshing, and budget-friendly products, such as bubble tea, milkshakes, ice cream, and seasonal offerings, the brand enjoys deep customer loyalty.\n\nThe opening ceremony was attended by representatives of Bing Chun Sri Lanka and the management team of LAUGFS Supermarkets.\n\nSpeaking at the opening ceremony, the Sector Managing Director / CEO \u2013 LAUGFS Retail, Niroshan De Silva, highlighted the significance of the franchise partnership and the customer-focused value it brings. \u201cBing Chun is all about creating happiness, and we must continue to foster that spirit by delivering memorable and enjoyable experiences for our customers. I would also like to thank the Bing Chun team for their excellent support in helping us establish this operation within a short period. The responsibility now lies with the sales team to deliver customer happiness and make this franchise partnership a success,\u201d he stated.\n\nRepresenting Bing Chun, the Investment Manager, Kelsi congratulated both teams on the successful launch and reaffirmed the company\u2019s commitment to supporting the growth and development of the business.\n\nCameraLK brings global spotlight to Sri Lanka with historic Sony Regional Wildlife Kando at Yala"
