    "chunk_text": "Roshanie brings with her a distinguished career spanning nearly four decades in the Sri Lankan corporate sector. At JKH, she served in three of the key business sectors: transportation, retail and property development.\n\nMore than a leadership appointment, this marks a defining moment in Celeste\u2019s evolution from a fast-growing founder-led company into a professionally governed brand with ambitions that extend far beyond conventional retail and quick commerce."
