    "num": "dailymirrorlk-12809b59",
    "date_str": "2026-06-12",
    "description": "SL-Thailand Business Council celebrates 25 years of strengthening biz relations",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/SL-Thailand-Business-Council-celebrates-25-years-of-strengthening-biz-relations/273-342671",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1781204771.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-06-12-dailymirrorlk-12809b59-0001",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "1725ebf3c5b3eb8109150580c601c7ef",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1674,
    "chunk_text": "Established at the dawn of a new millennium, the SLTBC emerged from a shared vision to promote closer commercial engagement between the two nations linked by centuries of cultural, religious and historical connections. Over the years, this vision has evolved into a dynamic platform that has supported entrepreneurs, investors, exporters and industry leaders in exploring new avenues of growth and collaboration.\n\nThe SLTBC\u2019s efforts have contributed to the growth of bilateral trade across a wide range of sectors, including agriculture, manufacturing, tourism, logistics, healthcare, education and emerging technologies. By bringing together business leaders and policymakers, the SLTBC has helped create an environment conducive to sustainable economic cooperation.\n\nThe relationship between Sri Lanka and Thailand is unique. Rooted in centuries of Buddhist heritage and cultural exchange, the friendship between the two nations has naturally expanded into a robust economic partnership. The SLTBC has consistently championed this relationship, recognising that strong cultural foundations provide a powerful platform for business collaboration.\n\nAs regional economies become increasingly interconnected, the SLTBC has remained committed to promoting innovation, entrepreneurship and cross-border partnerships that generate mutual value and long-term prosperity.\n\nWhile the 25th anniversary is an opportunity to reflect on past achievements, it is equally a moment to look forward.\n\nThe evolving global business landscape presents exciting opportunities in digital transformation, sustainable development, renewable energy, advanced manufacturing, tourism and services."
  },
