    "chunk_text": "99x CEO Hasith Yaggahavita stated, \u201cOur Breakfast Seminar in Oslo created interesting conversations around how software teams are approaching AI adoption and what it takes to transfer its potential into business outcomes. Moving from SDLC to AI-DLC is not about retrofitting existing processes; it is about rethinking how software is planned, built and operated in an AI-enabled era. Xianix was built to support that transition.\u201d"
