    "description": "SANASA General Insurance introduces One + Two concept",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/SANASA-General-Insurance-introduces-One-Two-concept/273-342675",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
