    "chunk_text": "Elderly man dies in elephant attack\n\nSerunuwara, June 12 (Daily Mirror) - A 72-year-old man was killed after being attacked by a wild elephant in the Sumedhankara area within the Serunuwara Police Division yesterday (11).\n\nPolice said the victim, a resident of Seruwila, sustained serious injuries in the attack and was admitted to the Serunuwara Hospital, where he later succumbed to his injuries.\n\nAccording to investigations, the man had been travelling on a road near his residence when he was attacked by the wild elephant.\n\nThe Serunuwara Police launched an investigation following information received regarding the incident. Further inquiries are continuing."
  },
