    "chunk_text": "Bollywood stars shine at BIA\n\nRenowned Bollywood personalities Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Aditya Roy Kapur, and Jacqueline Fernandez arrived at the Bandaranaike International Airport (BIA) today, adding a touch of glamour to the BIA Silk Route experience.\n\nThe celebrities were welcomed at the airport\u2019s exclusive fast-track service, BIA Silk Route, which is designed to provide passengers with enhanced comfort, convenience, and privacy. The service offers seamless assistance from arrival to departure, including priority processing and personalized support.\n\nBIA Silk Route continues to position itself as a premium airport experience, catering to high-profile travelers seeking efficiency and exclusivity."
