    "chunk_text": "\u2018Proposals on table, ball in Sri Lanka\u2019s court\u2019 \u2013 Envoy\n\nColombo, June 12 (Daily Mirror) - In reference to the planned move to purchase oil from Russia, Russian Ambassador Levan Dzhagaryan said that his country\u2019s proposals are now on the table, but the ball is in Sri Lanka\u2019s court.\n\nSpeaking at a reception held to mark Russia Day on Wednesday evening, he said Russian Deputy Energy Minister Roman Marshavin had visited Sri Lanka at the request of the Sri Lankan government and held discussions."
